    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1 class="hero-title">Hybrid Tuition in Hyderabad (Online + Offline at Jubilee Hills)</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">Hybrid classes = online teaching during the week + offline centre sessions for tests, revision and doubt-clearing.</p>
                <ul class="trust-points" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 2rem 0; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4b5563;">✓ Small batches: 3–5 students</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4b5563;">✓ One-on-one: available (centre/online)</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4b5563;">✓ Offline only at Jubilee Hills centre</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1rem; color: #4b5563;">✗ No home tuition visits</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What is Hybrid Tuition Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">What is Hybrid Tuition?</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Our hybrid tuition model combines the convenience of online learning with the effectiveness of in-person sessions:</p>
            <div class="content-grid">
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>Regular Online Classes</h3>
                    <p>Most classes are conducted online via live video (Zoom/Google Meet). You attend from your home, interact with the teacher in real-time, share your screen for problem-solving, and use digital resources.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>Periodic Centre Visits</h3>
                    <p>Weekend or monthly intensive sessions at our Jubilee Hills centre for doubt-clearing, tests, mock exams, and hands-on problem solving. These sessions build stronger rapport and ensure comprehensive learning.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>Same Teacher, Same Quality</h3>
                    <p>You get the same expert teacher and personalized attention - just flexible delivery. Whether online or offline, the quality and teaching methodology remain consistent.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-item">
                    <h3>Ideal for Far Areas</h3>
                    <p>Perfect for students whose schools are far from Jubilee Hills but want quality coaching. No daily commute, yet you still benefit from face-to-face interaction during centre visits.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Benefits Section -->
    <section class="section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Benefits of Our Hybrid Model</h2>
            <div class="offer-grid">
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>No Daily Commute</h3>
                    <p>Save 1-2 hours daily that would be spent traveling. Use that time for study, rest, or other activities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Access Expert Coaching</h3>
                    <p>Access expert coaching regardless of where you live in Hyderabad. Distance is no longer a barrier to quality education.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Face-to-Face Interaction</h3>
                    <p>Centre visits build stronger rapport with teachers and classmates. Personal interaction enhances learning and motivation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Recorded Sessions</h3>
                    <p>Online sessions are recorded and available for revision. Review concepts anytime, catch up on missed classes easily.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Flexible Schedule</h3>
                    <p>Flexibility to switch between online-only or hybrid based on your schedule. Adapt to exam periods, holidays, or personal needs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="offer-card">
                    <h3>Cost Effective</h3>
                    <p>Save on travel costs while getting the same quality education. Hybrid model offers value without compromising on learning outcomes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Areas Section -->
    <section id="areas" class="section" aria-labelledby="areas-heading">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 id="areas-heading" class="section-title">Areas We Serve (Online/Hybrid)</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Students from across Hyderabad join our online classes with optional visits to our Jubilee Hills centre:</p>
            <dl class="areas-list" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 2rem auto;">
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Gachibowli</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Online classes + optional centre sessions for tests</dd>
                
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Kondapur</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Hybrid plans for busy school schedules</dd>
                
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Madhapur</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Online learning + offline revision support</dd>
                
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Kukatpally</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Online/hybrid with centre-based tests</dd>
                
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Financial District</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Hybrid for students who want flexibility</dd>
                
                <dt style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #1e3a5f; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Hitech City</dt>
                <dd style="margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">Online classes + weekend centre visits</dd>
                
